[33mcommit 167634719601ffb9636e83509f214176174230b9[m
Author: devusr <devusr@localhost>
Date:   Mon Nov 16 01:20:07 2026 +0300

    One self-contained executable: embedded icon, console host and settings
    
    - conpty.dll + OpenConsole.exe are inside the exe, unpacked and loaded on first use
    - daemon runs from a private copy so the launched file is never locked
    - a newer build takes over an idle daemon automatically
    - config.json created on first run; old journals and leftovers pruned by the daemon
    - forge/ship.ps1 puts PROTEUS.exe on the Desktop after the gate passes
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>

